#X text 634 462 Stop first blocks the clock pulses \, and then sends the stop message. Most sequencers do nothing without a clock pulse \, so do that ASAP first \, then tell them they are stopped.;
#X text 172 462 Start and continue send the control message \, and then start allowing clock. Most sequencers ignore clock until they are started \, so do that ASAP first to not miss the next clock.;
#X text 638 639 To change the nudge size \, adjust the patch to use numbers other than -3 and 3 in these num2 controls (24 is a quarter note);
