#X text 1138 528 This patch is attributable to @Tuulikauri \; \; For a live show: - include "Technical MIDI solutions using tools by @Tuulikauri" in your show notes. Dont have any cause you're a tiny open mic? Dont worry about it until you make \$50 on a show \; \; For YouTube and other on-demand video content: \; - include "AbletonLink to MIDI clock Puredata patch by @Tuulikauri \, Download here" in the video notes \, clearly visible to viewers \; \; For live streams (Twitch \, YouTube live \, etc): \; - include "Streams typically include AbletonLink to MIDI clock Puredata patch by @Tuulikauri \, Download here" in your stream information \, clearly visible to viewers \; \; I don't need credit anywhere if you use this in your studio to make an album \, though it would be rad to hear that it was useful and how you used it \; \; For other situations just ask me if I want credit or not - @Tuulikauri everywhere \; \; If you want to sell a derivative product (patch \, software \, or hardware copying my tool) also reach out \, you're a good ethical fellow human and dont want to just rip off my work right? RIGHT?! I dont give you permission to do that unless you contact me and we have an agreement.;
